File: ChangeLog.md
Feature: slide-fixes

=======================================================================
Section 1
OLD_SECTION
- SPAEngine protected routes now work: ... instead of the route's `authURL`

## Removed

NEW_SECTION
- SPAEngine protected routes now work: ... instead of the route's `authURL`
- Slide with `use: "position"` now animates `right` and `bottom` as well as `left` and `top` ...
- `slide.toRight()` now honours `positionProperty`, as `toLeft()` does ...
- `slide.toRight()` now applies the same defaults as `toLeft()` ...
- `slide.toRight()` with `use: "dimension"` and no end width now opens to the content's width ...
- `slide.toLeft()` and `slide.toRight()` with `use` left out now animate the width ...

## Removed

REASON
